    "Freeze & Sign In predicts one exact immutable revision and binds the inactive token to that revision and catalog challenge. The authorization origin, resource, account, and scopes are shown before the browser opens; only the matching Test proof and catalog save can activate it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Freeze & Sign In predicts one exact immutable revision and binds the inactive token to that revision and catalog challenge. The authorization origin, resource, account, and scopes are shown before the browser opens; only the matching Test proof and catalog save can activate it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“冻结并登录”会预先确定一个精确的不可变修订，并将未激活令牌绑定到该修订和目录质询。浏览器打开前会显示授权来源、资源、账户和作用域；只有匹配的测试证明与目录保存才能将其激活。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
