    "Test & Save performs a real isolated initialize and complete negotiated discovery for this exact draft. Only the matching proof may commit a new immutable catalog revision." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Test & Save performs a real isolated initialize and complete negotiated discovery for this exact draft. Only the matching proof may commit a new immutable catalog revision."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“测试并保存”会对这份精确草稿执行真实的隔离初始化和完整协商发现。只有匹配的证明才能提交新的不可变目录修订。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test captures every listed executable, interpreter, script, package entrypoint, lockfile, and helper with no-follow identity checks. Save and launch reverify the same closure." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Test captures every listed executable, interpreter, script, package entrypoint, lockfile, and helper with no-follow identity checks. Save and launch reverify the same closure."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试会通过禁止跟随链接的身份检查捕获列出的每个可执行文件、解释器、脚本、软件包入口点、锁文件和辅助程序。保存和启动会重新验证同一闭包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test captures every listed executable, interpreter, script, package entrypoint, lockfile, and helper with no-follow identity checks. Save and launch reverify the same closure. macOS rejects helper-process authority because it cannot prove descendant process-group containment; exact helper execution is available only in the guarded Linux CLI runtime." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Test captures every listed executable, interpreter, script, package entrypoint, lockfile, and helper with no-follow identity checks. Save and launch reverify the same closure. macOS rejects helper-process authority because it cannot prove descendant process-group containment; exact helper execution is available only in the guarded Linux CLI runtime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试会使用 no-follow 身份检查捕获列出的每个可执行文件、解释器、脚本、软件包入口、锁文件和 helper。保存和启动会重新验证同一闭包。macOS 会拒绝 helper 进程权限，因为它无法证明后代进程组的封闭性；精确 helper 执行仅在受防护的 Linux CLI runtime 中可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
