    "This choice is saved and applied immediately; Cancel only discards provider edits. Rich Markdown uses the audited upstream renderer with images, math typesetting, and syntax highlighting disabled for the first release. Plain text safe mode bypasses Markdown entirely without changing session data." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This choice is saved and applied immediately; Cancel only discards provider edits. Rich Markdown uses the audited upstream renderer with images, math typesetting, and syntax highlighting disabled for the first release. Plain text safe mode bypasses Markdown entirely without changing session data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此选择会立即保存并应用；“取消”只会放弃提供商编辑。富文本 Markdown 使用经过审核的上游渲染器，首个版本暂不启用图像、数学公式排版和语法高亮。纯文本安全模式会完全绕过 Markdown，且不会更改会话数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This choice is saved and applied immediately; it is independent of provider Save. Rich Markdown uses the audited upstream renderer with images, math typesetting, and syntax highlighting disabled for the first release. Plain text safe mode bypasses Markdown entirely. Raw session data is unchanged." : {
